                        <tr><th>Attention:</th><td>Mr. Debasish Sar, Mr. Jayanta Bhattacharya</td></tr>
                        <tr><th>Project Title:</th><td>Requirement of Paint Booth & Paint Drying Oven</td></tr>
                        <tr><th>Date:</th><td>23/08/2022</td></tr>
