                        Dear Sir,<br>
                        We thankfully acknowledge receipt of your inquiry regarding your requirement for the mentioned subject.
                        We are pleased to submit herewith our proposal for your requirement.
                    </p>
                    <h6>The contents of the proposal are as Below: -</h6>
