                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <span>2. Scope of Supply</span>
                            <input type="checkbox" checked />
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <span>3. Technical Specifications for all equipment</span>
                            <input type="checkbox" checked />
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <span>4. Utility Requirements for the Plant</span>
                            <input type="checkbox" checked />
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <span>5. Make of Components</span>
                            <input type="checkbox" checked />
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <span>6. Exclusion List</span>
                            <input type="checkbox" checked />
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <span>7. Price Bid</span>
                            <input type="checkbox" checked />
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <span>8. Terms & Conditions</span>
                            <input type="checkbox" checked />
                        </li>
                    </ol>
                    <p>
                        We sincerely trust our proposal will be in line with your requirements, and we now look forward to receiving
                        your earliest favorable reply. Should you need further clarification, please feel free to contact us.
                        Thank you and always assuring our best services.


                    </p>
                    <p>Yours faithfully,</p>
                    <h5>For Bullows Paint Equipment Private Limited, </h5>
                    <br /><br />
                    <div>
                        <h6>James Wilson</h6>
                        <h6>Regional Manager- East & North </h6>
                    </div><hr />
                    <div style="background-color:lightgray">
                        <h5>
                            CC Mr. Abhay V. Gurav – Sales and Application- Sr. Manager
                        </h5>
                        <h5>Mr. Prashant R Waghulade - General Manager & Business Head</h5>
                    </div>

